{"toolCallId":"call_d6e27fd073a247f4b5f74e9c03ce86c7","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"FILE_EXISTS | base | Validates required spec documents for the declared documentation level.\nPLACEHOLDER_FILLED | base | Rejects unfilled template placeholders in authored spec documents.\nSCAFFOLD_NEVER_TOUCHED | base | Rejects scaffold-signature markers in required docs when spec.md claims Complete status.\nANCHORS_VALID | base | Checks anchors in each spec doc whose template defines them, ignoring fenced code; a phase parent is exempt, and research/research.md and review/review-report.md are skipped as free-form workflow documents. Errors: a doc with no anchors, an anchor opened twice, never closed, closed but never opened, or closed more times than it is opened. Nesting is also an error: an anchor opened inside another, closed before it is opened, or closed while another is still open, though markers quoted in inline code are ignored by the nesting check; an adr-NNN anchor may hold adr-NNN-* anchors. Template order is not checked.\nAI_PROTOCOLS | base | Validates AI execution protocol sections in high-governance specs.\nFRONTMATTER_VALID | base | Validates YAML frontmatter structure and required semantic values.\nLEVEL_MATCH | base | Checks required files match the declared documentation level.\nGRAPH_METADATA_SHAPE | base | Validates graph-metadata.json shape: required packet/derived blocks, last_active_child_id pointer integrity for phase parents.\nDESCRIPTION_SHAPE | base | Validates description.json shape: required name/description/level keys present and well-typed.\nTEMPLATE_SOURCE | base | Checks SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE provenance markers.\nCANONICAL_SAVE_ROOT_SPEC_REQUIRED | base | Ensures canonical saves include a root spec reference.\nCANONICAL_SAVE_SOURCE_DOCS_REQUIRED | base | Ensures canonical saves include source document references.\nCANONICAL_SAVE_LINEAGE_REQUIRED | base | Ensures canonical save lineage metadata is present.\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w8a66e200e3/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"d8cbea","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
