{"toolCallId":"call_ebe1a4b00df347dbb5595401d3cdeec0","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"9:! PLACEHOLDER_FILLED: 6 unfilled value token(s) in a Draft packet. Fill each one before the status leaves Draft\n10:    - implementation-summary.md:50: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Opening hook: 2-3 sentences on what changed and why it matters. Lead with impact.]\n11:    - implementation-summary.md:61: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: path] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Created/Modified/Deleted] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What this change accomplishe\n12:    - implementation-summary.md:70: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: How was this tested, verified and shipped? What was the rollout approach?]\n13:    - implementation-summary.md:81: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What was decided] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Active-voice rationale with specific reasoning] |\n14:    - implementation-summary.md:92: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Validation, lint, tests, manual check] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: PASS/FAIL with specifics] |\n15:    - implementation-summary.md:101: 1. **[YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Limitation]** [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Specific detail with workaround if one exists.]\n25:x GENERATED_METADATA_INTEGRITY: Generated metadata integrity found 1 violation(s) (enforced)\n26:    - graph-metadata.json: SOURCE_FINGERPRINT_MISMATCH: source_fingerprint does not match a re-derive of the current source docs, the stored derived fields may be stale\n27:x GENERATED_METADATA_DRIFT: Generated metadata drift found 1 drifted field(s) (enforced)\n28:    - description: stored 'Add a min-percent option to calculate-completeness.sh' drifted from fresh '`calculate-completeness.sh` prints `Overall Completion: N%` in text mode and `\"overallcompletion\": N` in JSON mode, then ends with an unconditional'\n32:    - spec.md Status=Draft classified=planned\n33:    - implementation-summary.md Status=<missing> classified=unknown\n57:    - code:not_opted_in\n60:Summary: Errors: 2  Warnings: 1\n62:RESULT: FAILED\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/cl